OL,3,GNEWSAFootball club apologises for
OL,4,AUnited 93 shirt advert
OL,5,
OL,6,FA football club has apologised after it
OL,7,Fpublished images of a new clothing line
OL,8,Fwith "United 93" printed on the back -
OL,9,Fthe call sign of one of the aircraft
OL,10,Fhijacked on 9/11.
OL,12,FThe clothing was supposed to make
OL,13,Freference to Oxford United's founding
OL,14,Fyear of 1893.
OL,16,FHowever, it said it had been released
OL,17,F"without understanding of the
OL,18,Fhistorical context and associations".
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
