OL,3,GNEWSAFootball club apologises for
OL,4,AUnited 93 shirt advert
OL,5,
OL,6,FUnited Airlines Flight 93 crashed in
OL,7,FShanksville, Pennsylvania, killing all
OL,8,F44 people on board after being hijacked
OL,9,Fon 11 September 2001. A docudrama film
OL,10,Ftitled United 93 was made about the
OL,11,Ftragedy and released in 2006.
